<title>USA: Chromcraft Revington to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Chromcraft Revington to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>DELPHI, Ind. 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chromcraft Revington Inc said Wednesday its board had authorized the repurchase of up to 200,000 shares of its common.</p>
<p>This represents about 3.5 percent of its 5,742,273 shares outstanding, the company said.</p>
<p>Purchases will be made in the open market or in privately negotiated transactions at times and prices that the company deems to be advantageous, it said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
